  "description": "Mail.dll is a robust, commercial-grade .NET library for working with IMAP, SMTP, POP3, and MIME protocols. It includes a powerful email and MIME parser, allowing you to send, receive, and process email messages in .NET applications. The library supports IMAP IDLE (push email), OAuth2 authentication (Gmail, Outlook), S/MIME encryption and signing, and advanced MIME parsing. It offers built-in SSL/TLS support, OAuth2 authentication, and DKIM signing and verification. Mail.dll also includes a secure MIME (S/MIME) parser for handling encrypted and digitally signed messages, along with parsers for iCal, vCard, and Outlook’s .msg file format. Additionally, it provides support for decoding winmail.dat attachments.",
